faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why choose architecture services and interiors together?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Designing both at once means windows, ceilings, lighting and furniture are planned as one, with fewer changes during construction.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Design That Respects the Site</h2>\n            <p>Good buildings work with their surroundings, not against them. Careful architecture services make the most of Rajokri's open land while dealing with its noise and heat. Each choice, from window size to roof colour, affects comfort for years.</p><p>Have a plot or estate in Rajokri? <a href=\"/rajokri/contact\">Talk to 9th Corner</a> about a site study.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}